        "type": "writing",
        "title": "The graphs below show the total percentage of films released and the total percentage of ticket sales in 1996 and 2000 in a country. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P3m6dRsufoW94RxXGOCldGvIgnb\"><em><strong>The graphs below show the total percentage of films released and the total percentage of ticket sales in 1996 and 2000 in a country. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "sort": 0,
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"Uqpqdj1GJoEkqlxj1aYlgWErguh\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Film Releases and Ticket Sales in 1996 and 2000</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N64jd9FvgoRfDTx2p91lBNjJgRc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TqPldEHP5oO9Eqxr2kRlefpxgtb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BYDmdTmrLovqhQx0Ps7lf6Hkg1b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i <em>Film Releases and Ticket Sales in 1996 and 2000</em> y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả tỷ lệ phần trăm phim được ph&aacute;t h&agrave;nh v&agrave; doanh thu b&aacute;n v&eacute; rạp chiếu phim của 4 thể loại phim trong 2 năm (1996 v&agrave; 2000).</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OVREdkcdDoiuwixGVrXlEimng9b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://youpass.vn/course-detail/124/ielts-writing-task-1-aim-6570-internal?collection=lesson&amp;item=5\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu 'tương đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span> trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong> </strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V2KUdr10HoS97zxVv0ilC6U1g9d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nội dung: </strong>Paraphrase đề <em>Film Releases and Ticket Sales in 1996 and 2000</em> với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: 2 bar charts - tỷ lệ phim được ph&aacute;t h&agrave;nh v&agrave; doanh thu b&aacute;n v&eacute; rạp - 4 thể loại phim (Drama, Comedy, Fantasy, Romance) - 2 năm (1996 v&agrave; 2000)</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SAQxdgsL6o1FJYx9eUwlYqvBgge\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề kh&ocirc;ng thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XQn8dU3IToFrThxBuZOlJ4Sdg5c\" data-list=\"bullet\"><strong>Trend</strong>: Hầu hết c&aacute;c thể loại tăng ở cả 2 chỉ số (film production v&agrave; ticket sales), chỉ c&oacute; Romance films c&oacute; doanh thu b&aacute;n v&eacute; giảm.</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FPj5dnUApovegdx2UfilgPTbgon\" data-list=\"bullet\"><strong>Differences</strong>: Drama c&oacute; tỷ lệ ph&aacute;t h&agrave;nh cao nhất trong cả 2 năm, nhưng Comedy thu h&uacute;t kh&aacute;n giả nhiều nhất (highest ticket sales).</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZrvgdhtrQovJnNxqKVSl5FLhgxe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; sự tương đồng, cụ thể như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CpWhdSGJFoye2PxbbFelCRADg5e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KYM4ddF3Nod0xmxPUhulWaqjg3d\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KmJidCEtvoXsooxfg0nlI3RngZd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> Drama v&agrave; Comedy (major genres)</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DKdhdanzMoMn9mxzY1klspUcgne\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OFNNdYzgHoQTvaxwNOglyfCdg3f\" data-list=\"bullet\">(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh initial figures năm 1996 của Drama v&agrave; Comedy ở CẢ 2 charts</strong> <em>(Film releases: Drama chiếm 27%, cao hơn đ&aacute;ng kể so với Comedy ở 20%. Ticket sales: Ngược lại, Comedy dẫn đầu với 20%, trong khi Drama chỉ 16%. Highlight sự đảo ngược giữa production v&agrave; sales)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OFNNdYzgHoQTvaxwNOglyfCdg3f\" data-list=\"bullet\">(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả sự thay đổi của Drama qua 2 năm ở cả 2 charts</strong> <em>(Film releases tăng mạnh l&ecirc;n 35%, tăng 8 điểm phần trăm. Ticket sales chỉ tăng nhẹ l&ecirc;n 17%. So s&aacute;nh tốc độ tăng kh&aacute;c nhau)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OFNNdYzgHoQTvaxwNOglyfCdg3f\" data-list=\"bullet\">(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả sự thay đổi của Comedy qua 2 năm ở cả 2 charts</strong> <em>(Film releases tăng l&ecirc;n 25%, ticket sales tăng l&ecirc;n 23%. Nhấn mạnh Comedy vẫn giữ vị tr&iacute; thể loại phổ biến nhất với kh&aacute;n giả)</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EwzTddSWRoqDSGxM4hFlvPg1grc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HdJgd2k5roDDvnxYToJlHaRBgCb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Rs1QdpGB7oSzzExe0VAlKiasg9e\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2:</strong><strong> Fantasy v&agrave; Romance (minor genres)</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K5dqd9nO1oWdKUxywl5l0bYggpe\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WpSFd3IqjoDLLsxA7FRlubh5g7d\" data-list=\"bullet\">(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh initial figures năm 1996 của Fantasy v&agrave; Romance ở CẢ 2 charts</strong> <em>(Film releases: Fantasy chiếm 12%, Romance 6%. Ticket sales: Fantasy chỉ 3%, Romance 5%)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WpSFd3IqjoDLLsxA7FRlubh5g7d\" data-list=\"bullet\">(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả sự thay đổi của Fantasy qua 2 năm ở cả 2 charts </strong><em>(Film releases tăng l&ecirc;n 16%. Ticket sales tăng gấp đ&ocirc;i l&ecirc;n 7%. Nhấn mạnh notably v&igrave; đ&acirc;y l&agrave; mức tăng đ&aacute;ng kể nhất về sales)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WpSFd3IqjoDLLsxA7FRlubh5g7d\" data-list=\"bullet\">(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả sự thay đổi của Romance qua 2 năm ở cả 2 charts</strong> <em>(Film releases kh&ocirc;ng đổi ở mức 6%. Ticket sales giảm 3 điểm phần trăm xuống chỉ c&ograve;n 2%. D&ugrave;ng \"In contrast\" để highlight Romance l&agrave; duy nhất c&oacute; xu hướng giảm)</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TOGCdDfzMo4b0vxNcTDlMZwkgW6\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bc2gdrij0o2chcxcadllSjTsgke\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XdYcdsZ6Uo6tuXxGPs3lNnJUgHh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HE29dhmJjod0qix8V1qlgw9gggc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KVX2dj2hXoaQicxXXS6licq4gdf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BMU6dhTL1o1FbTx3FwjlVZU7g6g\">Khi muốn diễn đạt \"<strong>films released/ticket sales</strong>\",&nbsp;ta c&oacute; thể d&ugrave;ng một số những cụm sau để c&oacute; thể đa dạng c&acirc;u của m&igrave;nh hơn nh&eacute;!</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9G5dxbOfoTmDRxOKw9loDfygsc\" data-list=\"bullet\">film production <em>(sản xuất phim)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9G5dxbOfoTmDRxOKw9loDfygsc\" data-list=\"bullet\">releases <em>(số phim ph&aacute;t h&agrave;nh)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9G5dxbOfoTmDRxOKw9loDfygsc\" data-list=\"bullet\">cinema-goers <em>(kh&aacute;n giả đến rạp)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9G5dxbOfoTmDRxOKw9loDfygsc\" data-list=\"bullet\">popularity among audiences (sự phổ biến với kh&aacute;n giả)</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HiBjdYruDodZggxuWQhlhVengvd\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Sq5TdyINToHWzoxG2iJlBtvog3b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-KEyPdA23dozSNDx0g8tl5JTTgM0\">Additionally, while drama represented the highest percentage of <strong>releases </strong>in both years, comedy consistently attracted the most <strong>cinema-goers</strong>.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>The majority of genres witnessed an increase in both <strong>film production</strong> and ticket sales over this period.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZD6tdIMdCoiL2cxB0EqlkTEPgnf\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
